  "description": "Construction of a single-storey flat-roofed side extension to the front of the property, incorporating a door and two skylights. The existing pitched roof over the porch will be extended across the new extension for visual continuity.\n\nConstruction of a single-storey rear extension with a flat roof, featuring three skylights, bi-folding doors, and one small window to the rear of the extension.\n\nLoft conversion with a hip-to-gable roof extension and rear dormer, including two rear-facing windows. Three skylights are proposed on the front roof slope, two with obscured glazing above the dormer bathroom and one above the staircase. Two additional skylights are proposed at the rear, one on the dormer flat roof and one above the dormer landing.\n\n",
